.TH AUTOGIT 1
.SH NAME
autogit \- consent-bound local Git control plane
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B autogit
.I COMMAND
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
AutoGit observes and commits only explicitly scoped, verified work. Provider
publication and public visibility require separate consent. Read-only commands
do not initialize state or contact a provider.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B version
Print build and compatibility identity.
.TP
.B doctor
Print an offline capability and state-health report.
.TP
.B status, plan, logs
Inspect repository lifecycle, candidate, and redacted audit state.
.TP
.B init, sync, verify, publish
Perform explicitly consented local workflow operations.
.TP
.B mcp serve
Run the pinned read-only MCP stdio server.
.SH OUTPUT
The default output is JSON with schema version autogit.result/1. Errors are
reported on stderr with a stable code and a non-zero exit status.
.SH SAFETY
AutoGit does not infer ownership from agent narration, force-push, delete user
refs, or expose source, prompts, credentials, raw paths, or remote URLs in
default state and diagnostics.
